                    <characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Your Turn</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit that had any damage points allocated to it this turn by this unit&apos;s combat attacks to be the targets.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic>
