                <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Each friendly **^^Blades of Khorne Daemon^^** unit that has used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is not in combat can move D6&quot;. It cannot end that move in combat.</characteristic>
