                    <characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"/>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If any damage points were allocated to an enemy **^^Hero^^** by this unit&apos;s combat attacks this turn and that enemy **^^Hero^^** has been destroyed, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s melee weapons for the rest of the battle.
